questions.stem:
Critically evaluate the effectiveness of the Pension Reform Act 2014's mandatory group life insurance obligation as a mechanism for extending life insurance coverage to the Nigerian workforce. In your answer, assess:
(a) the legal framework and its enforcement record;
(b) the structural advantages and limitations of group-based life insurance relative to individual life assurance;
(c) the role of NIIRA 2025 in strengthening employer compliance; and (d) the practical steps that NAICOM, PenCom, and the insurance industry should take to close the remaining compliance gap among SMEs and informal sector employers.
